Breaks: a merge judges whether main moved by comparing main's version with the cut's, so for a branch made from a branch, whose cut is numbered on the source's own line (item 105), main's commit since the cut goes unseen when the numbers coincide and the branch's version overwrites it (backlog 107, 2026-11-23).
Module: catalog-core
Test: MergeTest#aBranchOfABranchSeesMainMovedWhenTheNumbersCoincide

